laF9H-aI0cToBQ_WREOeWQa1Rinvg0lbKjAlG5tDToPQ7NzGi63DltM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQOyyjwMi4caZmG7UyZhfAwebWJG53lgoeGBdEDzdksBQ&oe=6AFB18E4"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00004.png", "id": "2581670642012581", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035444_2581670648679247_2063952322219638748_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kz10Q9KFO2wQ7kNvwFLq_yN&_nc_oc=AdpO5pop81qPQsvQk9tQjjOp-Yg19aKylyGZo0UEuvWcTP0wj9H_NS3wAIRBd7iDOUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSdIS4WpOZcoreOIghDI69uQRBOkP4gMEzYVkVcOonC-A&oe=6AFB19CF"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00012.png", "id": "730526755670372", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035373_730526759003705_5411714863732151420_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O00YsOORzvoQ7kNvwHnYwSJ&_nc_oc=AdrP95OQ6ppV0PlQfl1ZVa3U9s9iQL8SMUGIaNQ_QFwux_ZskMm2T2Ziz5K3wV7LOdg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxcbtf8AAav5YiuPm0JEAuf_hgQFaL4MsZ8DWFngZXUA&oe=6AFB478D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SN_2560x1440_4.png", "id": "3482402382066793", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392030_3482402385400126_1172834887376761250_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nEI6Tu-42y0Q7kNvwE1rzQk&_nc_oc=Adp1JYFOAyCgK08wXmKqN_SWs1XPAhDsi3E1Wr-HujLjgyha6EWm79OFZNh78GQ0vt0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQGmM2pPopwFI7u_r2V8xHorFFnuERSiSfLgXbB3Wkezg&oe=6AFB3EBE"}, "display_name": "Silent North", "keywords": ["survival", "action", "zombie", "FPS"], "long_description": "**Silent North is launching in Early Access Alpha**\n\nIn a post-apocalyptic world within the Swiss Alps, the land is in the overrun with the infected and other survivors that will treat you as friend or foe. Will you survive as a lone wolf, or make new bonds with strangers? Can you withstand the Silent North?\n\n# Lone Wolf or Group Up\n\nPlayers must survive the north using anything at their disposal. You can fight as a lone wolf in the wild or with friends in a home. Every encounter can change the outcome of your journey in the North. Your fate hangs on your ability to survive and the unpredictable forces of Nature and the Infected.\n\n# Looting\n\nIn the Swiss Alps, survival means scavenging gear from villages, like damaged clothes. Gather resources to keep yourself alive, or battle foes for superior equipment. For the boldest, venturing into quarantined zones yields invaluable loot.\n\n# Fight or Die Trying\n\nLittered with PVPVE action, players will not be able to escape an encounter with players, or the infected. Whether you're in the mountains or in the plains. Experience intense adrenaline pumping firefights to stay alive, or prey on your enemies to survive in the wilds. But tread carefully, there may be other players hiding and waiting to strike on you.\n\n# Surviving the Silent North\n\nIn the Swiss Alps, survival means facing the Infected and other players. Gathering resources is essential for sustaining basic needs like food, water, and warmth amidst constant danger. ", "short_description": "In a post-apocalyptic world within the Swiss Alps, the land is in the overrun with the infected and other survivors that will treat you as friend or foe. Will you survive as a lone wolf, or make new bonds with strangers? Can you withstand the Silent North?"}]}, "developer_name": "Combat Waffle Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beyondframes.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Beyond Frames Entertainment", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://combatwaffle.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_